                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game seems like a lot of fun, but it crashes to much at the moment.\nIt has tons of different maps and you can add points in buffs (your build) during a game. Like regeneration and faster shooting (which you lose afterwards though). Also, it can take a while for a game to start. Because of people not ready'ing up in game and only host can kick. But the gameplay, its good. Feels fast paced, controls work just fine. And it also brings some strategy into play. Needing a good team to survive. \n\nSo is this recommended?\nYes, but you might want to wait for bugs to be fixed.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JuaBW4WfvuU&feature=youtu.be",
